### Login for bimuser01
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/bimevents/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=bimuser01&password=bimuser01!&client_id=example-client&scope=openid profile email

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

